<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU" data-sig="links:sweep,buttons:arrow,tilt:1">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>MH Roof Plumbing — Metal Roofing, Gutters, Downpipes & Roof Repairs | Hunter & Port Stephens NSW</title>
<meta name="description" content="MH Roof Plumbing — metal roofing, gutters, fascia, downpipes, flashings and roof repairs across the Hunter and Port Stephens, NSW. Licensed roof plumbers (ABN 45 658 961 374). Call 0459 599 766.">
<meta property="og:title" content="MH Roof Plumbing — Metal Roofing, Gutters & Downpipes">
<meta property="og:description" content="Metal roofing, gutters, downpipes and roof plumbing repairs — Hunter & Port Stephens, NSW.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:image" content="assets/logo.png">
<link rel="icon" href="assets/logo.png">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo+Black:wght@400;700;800;900&family=Inter:wght@400;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root {
  --paper: #f2f2f2; --paper2: #f2eecc; --ink: #060607; --ink2: #5f5f5f;
  --acc: #f1db29; --acc2: #f4e258; --line: rgba(6,6,7,.16); --chip: #f2eecc;
  --deep: #000000; --light: #e3e3e3;
  --acc-text: #0c0e12;
  --fluid: clamp(44px, 9vw, 118px);
  --disp: 'Archivo Black', 'Arial Black', sans-serif; --body-font: 'Inter', sans-serif;
}
* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
html, body { overflow-x: hidden; }
section[id], header[id] { scroll-margin-top: 92px; }
body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.55; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
h1, h2, h3 { font-family: 'Archivo Black', 'Arial Black', sans-serif; }
h1 { text-transform: uppercase; }
.mono { font-family: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace; }
a { color: inherit; }
::selection { background: var(--acc); color: #0c0e12; }
html:not(.js) .rv { opacity: 1 !important; transform: none !important; }
.js .rv { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); transition: opacity .7s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1), transform .7s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1); }
.js .rv.on { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .js .rv { opacity: 1 !important; transform: none !important; transition: none !important; } .lb-pulse { animation: none; opacity: .5; } * { animation-duration: .001s !important; transition-duration: .001s !important; } }
.nav { position: fixed; inset: 0 0 auto 0; z-index: 60; background: rgba(242,242,242,.92); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
.nav-in { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.4rem; height: 80px; max-width: 1360px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 40px; }
.brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .75rem; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; min-width: 0; }
.brand img{height:42px;width:auto;object-fit:contain;border-radius:6px}
.brand .b-txt { display: flex; flex-direction: column; line-height: 1; min-width: 0; }
.brand-name { font-family: 'Archivo Black', 'Arial Black', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 2vw, 1.28rem); line-height: 1; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .01em; white-space: nowrap; }
.brand-sub { font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--acc-deep); font-weight: 700; margin-top: 3px; }
.nav-links { display: flex; gap: 1.3rem; margin-left: auto; align-items: center; }
.nav-links a { color: var(--ink2); text-decoration: none; font-size: .9rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .03em; }
.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--acc); }
.nav-cta { display: flex; gap: .8rem; align-items: center; }
.nav-p { font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink); }
.burger { display: none; margin-left: auto; background: none; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: .4rem .6rem; cursor: pointer; }
.burger span { display: block; width: 20px; height: 2px; background: var(--ink); margin: 4px 0; transition: .3s; }
.burger.open span:nth-child(1) { transform: translateY(6px) rotate(45deg); }
.burger.open span:nth-child(2) { opacity: 0; }
.burger.open span:nth-child(3) { transform: translateY(-6px) rotate(-45deg); }
@media(max-width:920px){
  .nav-links { position: fixed; inset: 80px 0 auto 0; background: rgba(242,242,242,.92); flex-direction: column; padding: 1.2rem; gap: 1rem; transform: translateY(-140%); transition: transform .35s ease; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .nav-links.open { transform: none; }
  .nav-links a { width: 100%; text-align: center; padding: .5rem 0; }
  .nav-cta { display: none; }
  .burger { display: block; }
}
.hero { position: relative; min-height: 92vh; display: flex; align-items: center; overflow: hidden; padding-top: 80px; background: #0d0b0a; perspective: 1200px; }
.hero-photo{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(10,11,12,.95) 0%,rgba(10,11,12,.7) 50%,rgba(10,11,12,.3) 100%)}
/* hero-photo uses gradient instead of stretched photo */
.hero-scrim { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 1; pointer-events: none; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(13,11,10,.78) 0%, rgba(13,11,10,.42) 34%, rgba(13,11,10,.55) 60%, rgba(13,11,10,.92) 100%); }
#heroCanvas {  }
.hero-in { position: relative; z-index: 3; padding: 9vh 40px 4rem; width: 100%; max-width: 1360px; margin: 0 auto; }
.hero-copy { max-width: 780px; min-width: 0; }
.hero-kicker { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .65rem; color: var(--acc); font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .26em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-shadow: 0 1px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.7); }
.hero-kicker::before { content: ""; width: 36px; height: 2px; background: var(--acc); }
.hero h1 { font-family: 'Archivo Black', 'Arial Black', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4.6vw, 3.9rem); line-height: 1.05; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 900; max-width: 24ch; letter-spacing: -.01em; text-shadow: 0 2px 26px rgba(0,0,0,.5); }
.hero h1 .acc { color: var(--acc); }
.hero h1 .thin { font-weight: 400; display: block; font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 1.7vw, 1.35rem); color: #d9d9d9; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; margin-top: 10px; }
.hero-sub { margin-top: 1.1rem; color: #e8e8e8; font-size: clamp(.98rem, 1.5vw, 1.12rem); max-width: 58ch; text-shadow: 0 1px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.6); }
.hero-cta { display: flex; gap: .9rem; margin-top: 1.8rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.hero .btn-ghost { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.62); color: #ffffff; background: rgba(13,11,10,.32); }
.hero .btn-ghost:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.14); border-color: #ffffff; }
.btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem; padding: .85rem 1.55rem; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 800; font-size: .95rem; transition: transform .15s ease, filter .15s ease; }
.btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); filter: brightness(1.06); }
.btn-primary { background: var(--acc); color: #0c0e12; }
.btn-ghost { border: 1.5px solid var(--ink); color: var(--ink); background: transparent; }
.hero-strip { margin-top: 2.4rem; display: flex; gap: 2.4rem; flex-wrap: wrap; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22); padding-top: 1.2rem; }
.hero-strip p { color: #c9c9c9; font-size: .7rem; letter-spacing: .13em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; }
.hero-strip strong { display: block; color: #ffffff; font-family: 'Archivo Black', 'Arial Black', sans-serif; font-size: 1.02rem; margin-top: .2rem; font-weight: 800; }
@media (max-width: 820px) { .hero-in { padding: 7vh 20px 3rem; } .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 8.6vw, 2.6rem); } }
section { padding: 5.4rem 0; }
.wrap { max-width: 1320px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 44px; }
.sec-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2.6rem; }
.sec-head::before { content: ""; width: 40px; height: 3px; background: var(--acc); flex: none; align-self: center; }
.sec-idx { font-size: .78rem; letter-spacing: .24em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--acc); font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.sec-kicker { font-size: .7rem; letter-spacing: .3em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--acc); font-weight: 800; }
.sec-title { font-family: 'Archivo Black', 'Arial Black', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.6vw, 2.9rem); font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.1; margin-top: .3rem; max-width: 28ch; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
.lead { color: var(--ink2); max-width: 60ch; margin-top: .9rem; }
.svc-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(292px, 1fr)); gap: 1.15rem; }
.svc-row { background: var(--chip); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.65rem 3.4rem 1.65rem 1.5rem; position: relative; overflow: hidden; transition: border-color .2s ease, transform .2s ease; }
.svc-row:hover { border-color: var(--acc); transform: translateY(-3px); }
.svc-row::after { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 44px; height: 3px; background: var(--acc); transition: width .3s ease; }
.svc-row:hover::after { width: 100%; }
.svc-body h3 { font-family: 'Archivo Black', 'Arial Black', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.12rem; margin-bottom: .35rem; }
.svc-body p { color: var(--ink2); font-size: .94rem; }
.svc-n { display: block; font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--acc-deep); letter-spacing: .1em; margin-bottom: .4rem; }
.svc-arrow { color: var(--acc-deep); font-size: 1.2rem; position: absolute; right: 18px; top: 16px; }
.steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(292px, 1fr)); gap: 1.15rem; }
.step { background: var(--chip); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.55rem 1.45rem; }
.step-n { font-family: 'Archivo Black', 'Arial Black', sans-serif; font-size: 1.75rem; line-height: 1; color: var(--acc); margin-bottom: .5rem; font-weight: 900; }
.step h3 { font-family: 'Archivo Black', 'Arial Black', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.06rem; margin-bottom: .3rem; }
.step p { color: var(--ink2); font-size: .92rem; }
.faq-wrap { max-width: 900px; }
details.faq { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 22px 0; }
details.faq:last-of-type { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
details.faq summary { font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; cursor: pointer; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
details.faq summary::after { content: "+"; font-size: 26px; color: var(--acc); font-weight: 400; transition: transform .2s; }
details.faq[open] summary::after { transform: rotate(45deg); }
details.faq .a { color: var(--ink2); padding: 14px 0 4px; max-width: 700px; }
.tst-grid, .trust-strip { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; }
.tst { background: var(--chip); border: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 30px; position: relative; }
.tst-q { font-size: 56px; line-height: 1; color: var(--acc); font-weight: 900; height: 30px; }
.tst p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 8px; }
.tst-a { margin-top: 20px; }
.tst-a b { font-size: 15px; }
.tst-a span { display: block; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink2); letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 2px; }
.band { background: var(--paper2); border-block: 1px solid var(--line); }
.trust-strip .tr-i { display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start; }
.tr-t { width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--acc); color: #0c0e12; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; flex-shrink: 0; }
.tr-i b { font-size: 15px; display: block; }
.tr-i span { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink2); }
.stat-band .wrap { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 30px; }
.stat { border-top: 3px solid var(--acc); padding-top: 18px; }
.stat b { font-size: clamp(36px, 4.6vw, 60px); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -.03em; display: block; line-height: 1; color: var(--acc); }
.stat span { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink2); letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 6px; display: block; }
@media (max-width: 900px) { .stat-band .wrap { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
.hgal { overflow-x: auto; scrollbar-width: none; cursor: grab; }
.hgal::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
.hgal .track { display: inline-flex; gap: 22px; padding: 0 44px; }
.hg-item { flex: 0 0 auto; width: min(560px, 78vw); margin: 0; }
.hg-item img { width: 100%; height: 380px; object-fit: cover; display: block; border-radius: 8px; }
.hg-item figcaption { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 12px 2px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink2); }
.hgal-nav { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: flex-end; padding: 0 44px; margin-top: 18px; }
.hgal-btn { width: 52px; height: 52px; border: 1.5px solid var(--ink); background: transparent; font-size: 20px; cursor: pointer; color: var(--ink); transition: background .15s, color .15s; }
.hgal-btn:hover { background: var(--acc); border-color: var(--acc); color: #0c0e12; }
footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 70px 0 0; background: var(--paper); }
footer .wrap { max-width: 1360px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 40px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.7fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px; }
footer h4 { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--acc); margin-bottom: 16px; }
footer a { display: block; text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink2); font-size: 14.5px; padding: 5px 0; }
footer a:hover { color: var(--acc); }
.fbrand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; }
.fbrand img{height:56px;width:auto;object-fit:contain;border-radius:6px}
.footer-bar { max-width: 1360px; margin: 50px auto 0; padding: 22px 40px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--ink2); }
@media (max-width: 900px) { footer .wrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
@media (max-width: 640px) { footer .wrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .fbrand img { height: 46px; } }
:root{--acc-deep:#6b6112;--acc-mid:#756a10}

/* pulse (fleet telemetry heartbeat) */
.lb-pulse { position: fixed; bottom: 1.5rem; right: 1.5rem; width: 10px; height: 10px; background: var(--acc); border-radius: 50%; opacity: .5; animation: lbPulse 2s ease-in-out infinite; pointer-events: none; z-index: 999; }
@keyframes lbPulse { 0%,100% { opacity: .3; transform: scale(1); } 50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.2); } }

/* text-accent overrides (dark golds for WCAG on light backgrounds) */
.sec-idx, .sec-kicker, .brand-sub, .svc-n, .svc-arrow,
footer h4, .nav-links a:hover, footer a:hover { color: var(--acc-deep); }
.step-n, .tst-q, .stat b, details.faq summary::after { color: var(--acc-mid); }

</style>
<noscript><style>.rv,.hg-item{opacity:1!important;transform:none!important;visibility:visible!important}</style></noscript><style id="lb-motion-css">
/* ==== LB MOTION PACK ==== */
.lb-rb,.lb-rb *,.lb-mq,.lb-mq *{box-sizing:border-box}
/* A header must never be hidden by a scroll-reveal state: the nav/brand is chrome, not
   content. Unrevealed .rv wrappers left whole headers at opacity:0 (invisible logo). */
header, .site-header, .page-header, nav.nav, .nav .rv, nav.rv, .header-inner, .nav-inner,
header .rv, .site-header .rv, .nav-inner .rv{
  opacity:1 !important; visibility:visible !important; transform:none !important;
}
.lb-rb{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#0c0d10}
.lb-mq{max-width:100%;overflow:hidden}
.lb-rb__track{position:relative;width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/7}
.lb-rb__slide{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0;transition:opacity .9s ease;will-change:opacity}
.lb-rb__slide.is-on{opacity:1}
.lb-rb__slide img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;transform:scale(1.03);transition:transform 7s linear}
.lb-rb__slide.is-on img{transform:scale(1.10)}
.lb-rb__cap{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;padding:clamp(14px,2.2vw,30px);
 background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent,rgba(6,7,10,.72));color:#fff;
 font-family:var(--lb-sub,Inter),sans-serif;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;
 font-size:clamp(9px,1vw,13px);z-index:2}
.lb-rb__dots{position:absolute;top:50%;right:clamp(10px,1.6vw,22px);transform:translateY(-50%);
 display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;z-index:3}
.lb-rb__dots button{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.7);
 background:transparent;cursor:pointer;padding:0;transition:transform .25s,background .25s}
.lb-rb__dots button.is-on{background:#fff;transform:scale(1.35)}
.lb-rb__nav{position:absolute;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);z-index:3;width:44px;height:44px;
 border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);background:rgba(8,9,12,.35);color:#fff;
 cursor:pointer;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:17px;line-height:1;backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
 transition:background .25s,transform .25s}
.lb-rb__nav:hover{background:rgba(8,9,12,.7)}
.lb-rb__nav--prev{left:clamp(10px,1.6vw,22px)}
.lb-rb__nav--next{right:clamp(10px,1.6vw,22px)}
.lb-rb__nav:active{transform:translateY(-50%) scale(.92)}
@media (max-width:700px){.lb-rb__track{aspect-ratio:4/3}.lb-rb__nav{width:36px;height:36px}}

a.btn,.btn,button.btn,.nav-cta a,.wp-block-button__link{position:relative;overflow:hidden;
 transition:transform .22s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.3,1),box-shadow .22s,filter .22s}
a.btn:hover,.btn:hover,button.btn:hover,.nav-cta a:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);
 box-shadow:0 10px 24px -12px rgba(0,0,0,.55);filter:brightness(1.05)}
a.btn:active,.btn:active,button.btn:active,.nav-cta a:active{transform:translateY(0) scale(.985)}
a.btn::after,.btn::after,.nav-cta a::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;width:38%;
 left:-60%;background:linear-gradient(100deg,transparent,rgba(255,255,255,.32),transparent);
 transform:skewX(-18deg);transition:left .55s ease;pointer-events:none}
a.btn:hover::after,.btn:hover::after,.nav-cta a:hover::after{left:130%}

.lb-rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px);transition:opacity .7s ease,transform .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.3,1)}
.lb-rv.is-in{opacity:1;transform:none}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
 .lb-rv{opacity:1!important;transform:none!important;transition:none!important}
 .lb-rb__slide img{transform:none!important;transition:none!important}
 a.btn::after,.btn::after,.nav-cta a::after{display:none}
}

/* marquee band (professional, reference-derived) */
.lb-mq{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#0b0c10;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10);
 border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10)}
.lb-mq__in{display:flex;width:max-content;animation:lb-mq 34s linear infinite}
.lb-mq:hover .lb-mq__in{animation-play-state:paused}
.lb-mq__in span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(18px,3vw,44px);
 padding:clamp(11px,1.5vw,19px) clamp(14px,2vw,26px);color:#fff;font-family:var(--lb-disp,Inter),sans-serif;
 font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;font-size:clamp(11px,1.25vw,17px);white-space:nowrap}
.lb-mq__in span i{font-style:normal;color:var(--lb-acc,#e51924)}
@keyframes lb-mq{from{transform:translateX(0)}to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){.lb-mq__in{animation:none}}
</style>
<style id="lb-hero-css">
canvas.lb-hero-canvas{position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; display:block; z-index:0; pointer-events:none}
canvas#heroCanvas, canvas.hero-canvas, canvas.lb3d-canvas{
  position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; display:block; z-index:0;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<script>document.documentElement.className+=' js';</script>
<nav class="nav"><div class="nav-in">
  <a class="brand" href="#top"><img src="assets/logo.png" alt="MH Roof Plumbing logo"><span class="b-txt"><span class="brand-name">MH Roof Plumbing</span><span class="brand-sub">Roof Plumbing &middot; Gutters &middot; Downpipes</span></span></a>
  <div class="nav-links" id="navlinks"><a href="#services">Services</a><a href="#process">Process</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a><a href="#quote">Quote</a></div>
  <div class="nav-cta"><span class="mono nav-p">0459 599 766</span><a href="#quote" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Get a quote</a></div>
  <button class="burger" id="burger" aria-label="Menu" aria-expanded="false"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
</div></nav>

<header class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="hero-photo"></div>
  <div class="hero-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <!-- LB-3D-HERO: hidden motion layer (3D scene retired for static preview) -->
  <canvas id="heroCanvas" width="600" height="600" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="hero-in">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="hero-kicker">Roof plumbing &middot; Gutters &middot; Downpipes &mdash; Hunter &amp; Port Stephens, NSW</p>
    <h1>Roofs that shed water,<br><span class="acc">done right.</span><br><span class="thin">Metal roofing &middot; Gutters &middot; Flashings &middot; Roof repairs</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Metal roofing, gutters, fascia, downpipes and flashings installed and repaired properly &mdash; so the water goes where it should, every time it rains. Licensed roof plumbers across the Hunter and Port Stephens.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#quote">Get a free quote</a>
