  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">01</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">What we do.</h2><p class="lead">From a leak to a full gutter and downpipe replacement — one roof plumber for the whole water-shedding system.</p></div></div>
  <div class="svc-grid"><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">01</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Metal roofing & re-roofing</h3><p>Colorbond and Zincalume roof sheets supplied, installed and flashed — new roofs and replacements.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">02</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Gutters & fascia</h3><p>Gutters replaced, re-pitched and re-sealed so the water sheds instead of spilling.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">03</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Downpipes & stormwater</h3><p>Downpipes and stormwater runs installed and rerouted to where the water should go.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div><div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">04</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Roof repairs, flashings & leaks</h3><p>Leaking flashings, valleys and penetrations found and fixed properly — first time.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div></div>
</div></section>

